      <sparkle:version>201</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Choose the thumbnail after capture (Settings → Screenshots): Boardshot's (file saved right away), the macOS one (with its Markup editor; the file arrives once the thumbnail goes away, and macOS may not show it for captures on a second display), or none.</li>
<li>Opening a second copy of Boardshot now brings up the one already running instead of running both.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
